        ],
        "text": "This case concerns Philip Morris USA\u2019s challenge to an Oregon jury instruction on punitive damages in a lawsuit brought by Mayola Williams."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "993aa0c4ef6b77e24ec87cc1352c15fd9435a9b5b0e61587f26188cb0fb7d929",
