              "ev-993aa0c4ef6b-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that the Oregon courts erred in not applying the Supreme Court\u2019s State Farm precedent after the case was remanded."
